 같이 안내하오니 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">1. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">신청 기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012.11.12.(월)～11.15.(목)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">신청 방법 및 장소</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 그린에너지융합센터 (LINC사업단 “종합행정실” : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">그린에너지관 401호</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 경유(날인)한 후 연계전공 이수 포기(변경)원을 그린에너지융합센터</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">에 제출.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -178.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">신청 서류</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">연계전공 포기(변경)신청서 및 성적증명서(원본) 각 1부</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -178.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">4. 참고사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -38.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">연계전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 과목 중 주전공 교과목이 아닌 참여 전공 교과목의 이수학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정하며, 복수전공 또는 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 해당 전공학점으로 인정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #000066; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">졸업 대상자 중에서 연계전공 이수자로 선발 되었으나, 이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 합니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012. 11. 01.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 7.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">그린에너지융합센터장</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 3.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">☏478-7974</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
